40575',to_date('01/31/2012 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),null,null,'N',null,'n/a','N','Y','N','N',to_date('11/15/2007 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'Closed','4132 Napali Place','Honolulu','HI','96816',null,'Melanie G. Abecassis','ABECASSIS MELANIE G 542020','Y','N','N',null,'MABECASSIS','N',null,null,'N',null,'MABECASS','France','France',null,null,'Honolulu','HI','O','JIMAR,  RCUH',to_date('01/02/2007 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),to_date('09/01/2008 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'Polovina, Jeffrey','(808) 983-5390','N/A','France','N','Ms. Abecassis will work at the Pacific Islands Fisheries Science Center from 02/01/07 to 01/09/08.  She applies analytical models to data on horizontal and vertical movements and habitats of large pelagic animals including bigeye tuna, albacore tuna, and sea turtles.  A considerable electronic tagging data base has already been collected so the focus of the position is on analyses of these data.  Analyses may include linking the movement data with oceanographic data and/or building spatial movement modes.  Co-authors reports and manuscripts describing area of research for publication.  Also participates in the division?s oceanographic research cruise (21 days).  During her stay, Ms. Abecassis will have access to public areas but not to sensitive information.  In addition, Ms. Abecassis will have no access to controlled technologies during his stay.','N','N/A','N',null,null,'Annex-2 (EWC), Library/Mail, Mag_137, A1',to_date('09/13/2007 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'PICADM',to_date('06/02/2020 16:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'PAULI.SALMU');
