,to_date('04/25/2006 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),null,'PIV11-W-44479',to_date('10/28/2011 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'26923',to_date('02/27/2009 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),null,null,'n/a',null,'Y',null,null,to_date('11/28/2007 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'SAC','59-606 Pupukea Road','Haleiwa','HI','96712',null,'Frances Lichowski','LICHOWSKI FRANCES 528542','Y',null,null,null,'FLICHOWSKI',null,null,null,null,null,null,'Germany','Germany',null,null,'Honolulu','HI','G','JIMAR, CRED',to_date('10/11/2005 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),to_date('05/30/2008 00:00:00','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'Brainard, Russell','(808) 592-7011','Kewalo Researvh Facility','Germany','N','The primary duty for the temporary seabed mapping specialist will be spending two months at sea on mapping cruises:  HI-06-05 ? April 19-May 9, 2006 and HI-06-07 ? June 17-July 15, 2006.  On these cruises, the mapping specialist will stand watch aboard ship, participate in surveys on the R/V AHI, and participate in multibeam data cleaning. Prior to HI-06-05, the mapping specialist will assist in preparation and complete training needed for the cruise.  While ashore, the mapping specialist will provide primary support for finalization of multibeam cleaning for the HI-06-05 and HI-06-07 data, assist in backscatter data processing, and assist in preparation for HI-06-07.  Restricted data or technology will not be accessed.',null,'N/A','N',null,null,null,null,null,to_date('11/03/2010 08:29:15','MM/DD/YYYY HH24:MI:SS'),'LJOHANNES');
